 *Q2. What is Collections? Write a program to remove duplicate names using Collections*

*Answer:*
Collections nu solladhu group of objects ah store panna use aagura framework. List, Set, Map lam varum. Duplicate ah remove panna `Set` best.

*Java Example - Using HashSet:*
import java.util.*;

public class RemoveDuplicates {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        // List with duplicates
        List<String> names = new ArrayList<>();
        names.add("Swathi");
        names.add("Arun");
        names.add("Swathi");
        names.add("Kumar");
        names.add("Arun");
        
        System.out.println("Before: " + names);
        
        // HashSet ku pota duplicate automatic ah pogidum
        Set<String> uniqueNames = new HashSet<>(names);
        
        System.out.println("After: " + uniqueNames);
    }
}
*Output:*
Before: [Swathi, Arun, Swathi, Kumar, Arun]
After: [Kumar, Arun, Swathi]
